SUMMARY:First Friday Art Crawl in Shepherdstown!
ORGANIZATION:Experience Shepherdstown
LOCATION:Shepherdstown - All Around Town
DESCRIPTION:<p>First Friday Art Crawl\nApril 3 | 5–8 PM\nExperience the creativity of Shepherdstown during April's First Friday Art Crawl\, a free celebration of local art and community!\nArt Crawl Stops:\n📍 Wings of Dreams\, 139 W German St – Artist Debut for Shepherdstown resident illustrator and painter Madeleine King. Paintings and photography by Shepherdstown resident Dinah Bartch. Open House & Coloring Pages for kids!\n📍 Nightburner Print Co\, 133 W German St – Join Hatch Match Baits and Live Rough Die Tough for the launch of their new limited-edition collaboration\, featuring custom goby-style smallmouth baits and a premium collaborative t-shirt (sizes S–3XL). Meet JP and TJ\, hear some fish stories\, and check out the new gear!\n📍 Tooth & Nail Tattoo\, 133 W German St – Tattoo Art for sale!\n📍 Badgerhound Gallery\, 110 W German St – Details coming soon...\n📍 Little Free Art Gallery\, 110 W German St (outside) – Bring something to exchange!\n📍 Cooper Captures Gallery\, 112 E German St – Free gift with any print or canvas purchase.\n📍 Skull City Studio\, 105 South Princess St – Pieced Together - A Quilt Showcase: Come marvel at quilts new and old of all sizes.\n📍 Make It Shepherdstown\, 109 South Princess St – 4-6pm 3D Printed Egg Painting - fun for all!\n📍 Black Box Arts Center\, 113 South Princess St – Roving Peregrine Theatre Company's Art Exhibit\, Visual art by local actors!\n📍 Game Knights\, 400 South Princess St – Artisans’ Quest:  Anime and Gaming Art Exhibit\n📍 The Bridge Gallery\, 8566 Shepherdstown Pike – New paintings by Seth Hill & David Bottini. Meet David Bottini 6-7pm.\nSponsored by the Town of Shepherdstown and brought to you by Experience Shepherdstown.\nShops open late!\nFirst Friday Specials:\nSand & Pine\, 141 W German St – 30% off Storewide (Excluding Consignment) Hop Into Spring sale starting Friday 4/3 through Sunday 4/5\nMore stops and details coming soon...Visit shepherdstown.info for updates\nSponsored by the Town of Shepherdstown and brought to you by Experience Shepherdstown.\nMore stops and details coming soon...\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Shepherdstown - All Around Town\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Experience Shepherdstown experienceshepherdstown@gm ail.com </p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Community & Civic
URL:https://shepherdstown.info/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
