SUMMARY:Appalachian Cellar Tasting Event
ORGANIZATION:Train Station at Shepherdstown
LOCATION:Train Station at Shepherdstown
DESCRIPTION:<p>A curated tasting experience celebrating the artisan makers of Appalachia. Join us for an intimate evening — a rare opportunity to taste\, discover\, and connect with the remarkable artisan products of the Appalachian Cellar. From the fertile hollows and ridge-top farms of West Virginia\, we bring you a showcase that is as much story as it is flavor.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Train Station at Shepherdstown\, 100 Audrey Egle Drive\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Molly Sutter 2158062415 msutter@shepherd.edu</p
CATEGORIES:Uncategorized
URL:https://www.soilhealthtoshelf.com/tastingevent
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
