SUMMARY:Breakfast with the Easter Bunny
ORGANIZATION:Blue Moon Cafe
LOCATION:Blue Moon Cafe
DESCRIPTION:<p>Lions Club Annual Breakfast with the Easter Bunny\nEnjoy Breakfast with the Easter Bunny at the Blue Moon Café on Saturday\, April 19\, 2025 from 8 to 11 a.m. Pancakes\, eggs\, sausage and bacon!\nThis fun-filled breakfast is sponsored by the Shepherdstown Centennial Lions Club and the Blue Moon Café\, 200 E. High Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV.\nBring your cameras to take pictures of your child(ren) with the Easter Bunny.\nChildren ages 3 and under are free\; children ages 4-12 are $5 each\; and adults (13 years and older) are $10 each. No tickets are necessary\, just pay at the door.\nFree parking at the meters and University lot near Blue Moon Café. For more information\, go to Facebook Shepherdstown Centennial Lions Club or email ShepLionsClub@gmail.com\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Blue Moon Cafe\, 200 E. High Street\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Cheryl Roberts 304-876-2277 cdlroberts@comcast.net</p
CATEGORIES:Holidays & Fairs
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
