SUMMARY:Pieced Together // Printmaking Workshop
ORGANIZATION:Skull City Studio
LOCATION:Skull City Studio
DESCRIPTION:<p>In this 2-hour hands-on workshop\, you'll use pre-made linoleum blocks to turn quilt patterns into wearable art! Each participant will print a bandana to take home\, explore basic printing techniques\, and experiment with color and composition. No prior experience needed. $28 at the door.\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Skull City Studio\, 105 S. Princess St. \, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Pang Tubhirun hello@skullcitystudio.com </p
