SUMMARY:Sing mother Earth Into bloom.~ A vocal workshop of resonance and renewal
ORGANIZATION:Sacred Roots Herbal Sanctuary
LOCATION:Sacred Roots Herbal Sanctuary
DESCRIPTION:<p>Discover how to use your voice for well-being.\nThis workshop reframes singing as essential self-care\, guiding you to reclaim your voice and renew your well-being through inner resonance.\nWhat to expect\n-Singing and making a joyful noise.\n-Chanting\, toning\, voicing\n-Singing meditation and song circle.\n-How to move from performance to presents\, sing for self\, and how to focus on well-being not technique.\nSliding Scale $35 to $45\nEmail info@sacredrootswv.com to register and pay.\nFacilitated byPatty Progecene: Patty is a seasoned vocal coach and performing vocalist with a lifetime experience. As a lifelong singer she understands the transformational power of finding one's own voice. Operating from her home in Thurmont Maryland she helps singers of all ages unlock their potential through private voice instruction\, themed workshops\, and engaging classes.\nsoulofsinging@gmail.com\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Sacred Roots Herbal Sanctuary\, 1799 Persimmon Lane\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, United States</p
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture, Education & Workshops
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SOURCE:shepherdstown.info
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
