SUMMARY:Earth Fest and Blue Ridge Arts & Crafts Festival
ORGANIZATION:Morgan's Grove Park
LOCATION:Morgan's Grove Park
DESCRIPTION:<p>We're so excited to be partnering with the annual Earth Fest for the May 2nd Spring Blue Ridge Arts & Crafts Festival at Morgan’s Grove Park in Shepherdstown: combining amazing local artists\, live music\, delicious food and drinks\, Earth Day related nonprofits/educational booths\, and a plant sale to benefit beautiful Morgan’s Grove Park!\n\n<b>Location Details:</b> Morgan's Grove Park\, Kearneysville Pike\, Shepherdstown\, WV\, 25443\, US\n\n<b>Contact Info:</b> Michelle Kwiatkowski (202) 525-6076 wvblueridgefestival@gmail.com</p
